{"question_id":"m9f8syt9","content":"<p>Match <b>List - I</b> with <b>List - II</b>.</p>\n<table border=\"1\">\n  <tr>\n    <th>List - I</th>\n    <th>List - II</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(A) Solution of chloroform and acetone</td>\n    <td>(I) Minimum boiling azeotrope</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(B) Solution of ethanol and water</td>\n    <td>(II) Dimerizes</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(C) Solution of benzene and toluene</td>\n    <td>(III) Maximum boiling azeotrope</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(D) Solution of acetic acid in benzene</td>\n    <td>(IV) \u0394V<sub>mix</sub> = 0</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<p><b>Choose the correct answer from the options given below :</b></p>","chapter":"solutions","chapterGroup":"physical-chemistry","country":"in","difficulty":"medium","exam":"jee-main","examGroup":"jee","isBonus":false,"isOutOfSyllabus":false,"languages":["en","hi"],"marks":4,"negMarks":1,"paperId":"jee-main-2025-online-7th-april-evening-shift","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2025 (Online) 7th April Evening Shift","permalink":"pmatch-blist-ib-with-blist-iibp-table-b-jee-main-chemistry-8o7v2nlgh26zhp2r","question":{"en":{"comprehension":null,"direction":null,"content":"<p>Match <b>List - I</b> with <b>List - II</b>.</p>\n<table border=\"1\">\n  <tr>\n    <th>List - I</th>\n    <th>List - II</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(A) Solution of chloroform and acetone</td>\n    <td>(I) Minimum boiling azeotrope</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(B) Solution of ethanol and water</td>\n    <td>(II) Dimerizes</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(C) Solution of benzene and toluene</td>\n    <td>(III) Maximum boiling azeotrope</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(D) Solution of acetic acid in benzene</td>\n    <td>(IV) \u0394V<sub>mix</sub> = 0</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<p><b>Choose the correct answer from the options given below :</b></p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"<p>(A)-(III), (B)-(I), (C)-(IV), (D)-(II)</p>"},{"identifier":"B","content":"<p>(A)-(III), (B)-(IV), (C)-(I), (D)-(II)</p>"},{"identifier":"C","content":"<p>(A)-(II), (B)-(I), (C)-(IV), (D)-(III)</p>"},{"identifier":"D","content":"<p>(A)-(II), (B)-(IV), (C)-(I), (D)-(III)</p>"}],"correct_options":["A"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>To correctly match the items from List - I with those in List - II, let's analyze the characteristics of each solution:</p>\n\n<p><p><strong>(A) Solution of chloroform and acetone:</strong> This solution exhibits negative deviation from Raoult's law. It creates a maximum boiling azeotrope because the interactions between chloroform and acetone molecules are stronger than those in the pure components.</p></p>\n<p><p><strong>(B) Solution of ethanol and water:</strong> This solution shows positive deviation from Raoult's law, leading to the formation of a minimum boiling azeotrope. The interactions between ethanol and water molecules are weaker than those in their pure states.</p></p>\n<p><p><strong>(C) Solution of benzene and toluene:</strong> This combination forms an ideal solution where Raoult\u2019s law is obeyed across all concentrations. Thus, the volume change upon mixing, denoted as <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.72ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.271ex\" height=\"2.34ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 2771.8 1034.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(833,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(616,-176.7) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">mix</text></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, is zero.</p></p>\n<p><p><strong>(D) Solution of acetic acid in benzene:</strong> In this mixture, acetic acid tends to dimerize. The acetic acid molecules pair up, forming dimers, especially in non-polar solvents like benzene.</p></p>\n\n<p>Based on these explanations, the correct matches are: </p>\n\n<p><p>(A) - (III)</p></p>\n<p><p>(B) - (I)</p></p>\n<p><p>(C) - (IV)</p></p>\n<p><p>(D) - (II)</p></p>\n"},"hi":{"direction":null,"comprehension":null,"content":"<p>\u0938\u0942\u091a\u0940-I \u0915\u093e \u0938\u0942\u091a\u0940-II \u0915\u0947 \u0938\u093e\u0925 \u092e\u093f\u0932\u093e\u0928 \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902 :</p>\n<p>\n<table class=\"tg\" style=\"undefined;table-layout: fixed; width: 652px\"><colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 84px\">\n<col style=\"width: 197px\">\n<col style=\"width: 83px\">\n<col style=\"width: 73px\">\n<col style=\"width: 215px\">\n</colgroup>\n<thead>\n  <tr>\n    <th class=\"tg-c3ow\"></th>\n    <th class=\"tg-c3ow\">\u0938\u0942\u091a\u0940-I</th>\n    <th class=\"tg-c3ow\"></th>\n    <th class=\"tg-c3ow\" colspan=\"2\">\u0938\u0942\u091a\u0940-II<br></th>\n  </tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">A</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0pky\">\u0915\u094d\u0932\u094b\u0930\u094b\u092b\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092e \u090f\u0935\u0902 \u0910\u0938\u0940\u091f\u094b\u0928 \u0915\u093e \u0935\u093f\u0932\u092f\u0928</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">I</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\" colspan=\"2\">\u0928\u094d\u092f\u0942\u0928\u0924\u092e \u0915\u094d\u0935\u0925\u0928\u093e\u0902\u0915\u0940 \u0938\u094d\u0925\u093f\u0930\u0915\u094d\u0935\u093e\u0925\u0940</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">B</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0pky\">\u0910\u0925\u0947\u0928\u0949\u0932 \u090f\u0935\u0902 \u091c\u0932 \u0915\u093e \u0935\u093f\u0932\u092f\u0928</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">II</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\" colspan=\"2\">\u0926\u094d\u0935\u093f\u0924\u092f \u092c\u0928\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">C</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0pky\">\u092c\u0947\u0928\u094d\u091c\u0940\u0928 \u090f\u0935\u0902 \u091f\u0949\u0932\u0942\u0908\u0928 \u0915\u093e \u0935\u093f\u0932\u092f\u0928</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">III</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\" colspan=\"2\">\u0905\u0927\u093f\u0915\u0924\u092e \u0915\u094d\u0935\u0925\u0928\u093e\u0902\u0915\u0940 \u0938\u094d\u0925\u093f\u0930\u0915\u094d\u0935\u093e\u0925\u0940</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">D</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0pky\">\u092c\u0947\u0928\u094d\u091c\u0940\u0928 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0910\u0938\u0940\u091f\u093f\u0915 \u0905\u092e\u094d\u0932 \u0915\u093e \u0935\u093f\u0932\u092f\u0928</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">IV\t</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\" colspan=\"2\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.72ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11.379ex\" height=\"2.34ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 5029.6 1034.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(833,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(616,-176.7) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">mix\u00a0</text></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3473.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(4529.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table></p>\n<p>\u0928\u0940\u091a\u0947 \u0926\u093f\u090f \u0917\u090f \u0935\u093f\u0915\u0932\u094d\u092a\u094b\u0902 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0938\u0947 \u0938\u0939\u0940 \u0909\u0924\u094d\u0924\u0930 \u091a\u0941\u0928\u0947\u0902 :</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"<p>(A)-(III), (B)-(I), (C)-(IV), (D)-(II)</p>"},{"identifier":"B","content":"<p>(A)-(III), (B)-(IV), (C)-(I), (D)-(II)</p>"},{"identifier":"C","content":"<p>(A)-(II), (B)-(I), (C)-(IV), (D)-(III)</p>"},{"identifier":"D","content":"<p>(A)-(II), (B)-(IV), (C)-(I), (D)-(III)</p>"}],"correct_options":["A"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>\u0938\u0942\u091a\u0940 - I \u0915\u0940 \u092e\u0926\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u094b \u0938\u0942\u091a\u0940 - II \u0915\u0947 \u0938\u093e\u0925 \u0938\u0939\u0940 \u0922\u0902\u0917 \u0938\u0947 \u092e\u093f\u0932\u093e\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f, \u0906\u0907\u090f \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0924\u094d\u092f\u0947\u0915 \u0935\u093f\u0932\u092f\u0928 \u0915\u0940 \u0935\u093f\u0936\u0947\u0937\u0924\u093e\u0913\u0902 \u0915\u093e \u0935\u093f\u0936\u094d\u0932\u0947\u0937\u0923 \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902:</p>\n\n<p><p><strong>(A) \u0915\u094d\u0932\u094b\u0930\u094b\u092b\u0949\u0930\u094d\u092e \u0914\u0930 \u090f\u0938\u0940\u091f\u094b\u0928 \u0915\u093e \u0935\u093f\u0932\u092f\u0928:</strong> \u092f\u0939 \u0935\u093f\u0932\u092f\u0928 \u0930\u093e\u0909\u0932\u094d\u091f \u0915\u0947 \u0928\u093f\u092f\u092e \u0938\u0947 \u090b\u0923\u093e\u0924\u094d\u092e\u0915 \u0935\u093f\u091a\u0932\u0928 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0926\u0930\u094d\u0936\u093f\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u092f\u0939 \u090f\u0915 \u0909\u091a\u094d\u091a\u0924\u092e \u0915\u094d\u0935\u0925\u0928\u093e\u0902\u0915 \u0938\u094d\u0925\u093f\u0930\u0915\u094d\u0935\u093e\u0925\u0940 \u092e\u093f\u0936\u094d\u0930\u0923 \u092c\u0928\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u0915\u094d\u092f\u094b\u0902\u0915\u093f \u0915\u094d\u0932\u094b\u0930\u094b\u092b\u0949\u0930\u094d\u092e \u0914\u0930 \u090f\u0938\u0940\u091f\u094b\u0928 \u0905\u0923\u0941\u0913\u0902 \u0915\u0947 \u092c\u0940\u091a \u0905\u0928\u094d\u092f\u094b\u0928\u094d\u092f\u0915\u094d\u0930\u093f\u092f\u093e\u090f\u0902 \u0936\u0941\u0926\u094d\u0927 \u0918\u091f\u0915\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0940 \u0924\u0941\u0932\u0928\u093e \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0905\u0927\u093f\u0915 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u092c\u0932 \u0939\u094b\u0924\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964</p></p>\n<p><p><strong>(B) \u090f\u0925\u0947\u0928\u0949\u0932 \u0914\u0930 \u091c\u0932 \u0915\u093e \u0935\u093f\u0932\u092f\u0928:</strong> \u092f\u0939 \u0935\u093f\u0932\u092f\u0928 \u0930\u093e\u0909\u0932\u094d\u091f \u0915\u0947 \u0928\u093f\u092f\u092e \u0938\u0947 \u0927\u0928\u093e\u0924\u094d\u092e\u0915 \u0935\u093f\u091a\u0932\u0928 \u0926\u0930\u094d\u0936\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948, \u091c\u093f\u0938\u0938\u0947 \u0928\u094d\u092f\u0942\u0928\u0924\u092e \u0915\u094d\u0935\u0925\u0928\u093e\u0902\u0915 \u0938\u094d\u0925\u093f\u0930\u0915\u094d\u0935\u093e\u0925\u0940 \u092e\u093f\u0936\u094d\u0930\u0923 \u0915\u093e \u0928\u093f\u0930\u094d\u092e\u093e\u0923 \u0939\u094b\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u090f\u0925\u0947\u0928\u0949\u0932 \u0914\u0930 \u091c\u0932 \u0905\u0923\u0941\u0913\u0902 \u0915\u0947 \u092c\u0940\u091a \u0905\u0928\u094d\u092f\u094b\u0928\u094d\u092f\u0915\u094d\u0930\u093f\u092f\u093e\u090f\u0902 \u0909\u0928\u0915\u0940 \u0936\u0941\u0926\u094d\u0927 \u0905\u0935\u0938\u094d\u0925\u093e\u0913\u0902 \u0915\u0940 \u0924\u0941\u0932\u0928\u093e \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0915\u092e\u091c\u094b\u0930 \u0939\u094b\u0924\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964</p></p>\n<p><p><strong>(C) \u092c\u0947\u0902\u091c\u0940\u0928 \u0914\u0930 \u091f\u0949\u0932\u0942\u0908\u0928 \u0915\u093e \u0935\u093f\u0932\u092f\u0928:</strong> \u092f\u0939 \u0938\u0902\u092f\u094b\u091c\u0928 \u090f\u0915 \u0906\u0926\u0930\u094d\u0936 \u0935\u093f\u0932\u092f\u0928 \u092c\u0928\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u091c\u0939\u093e\u0902 \u0930\u093e\u0909\u0932\u094d\u091f \u0915\u093e \u0928\u093f\u092f\u092e \u0938\u092d\u0940 \u0938\u093e\u0902\u0926\u094d\u0930\u0924\u093e\u0913\u0902 \u092a\u0930 \u092a\u093e\u0932\u0928 \u0915\u093f\u092f\u093e \u091c\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0907\u0938 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0915\u093e\u0930, \u092e\u093f\u0936\u094d\u0930\u0923 \u092a\u0930 \u0906\u092f\u0924\u0928 \u092a\u0930\u093f\u0935\u0930\u094d\u0924\u0928, \u091c\u093f\u0938\u0947 <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.72ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.271ex\" height=\"2.34ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 2771.8 1034.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(833,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(616,-176.7) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">mix</text></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> \u0926\u094d\u0935\u093e\u0930\u093e \u0926\u0930\u094d\u0936\u093e\u092f\u093e \u091c\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948, \u0936\u0942\u0928\u094d\u092f \u0939\u094b\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964</p></p>\n<p><p><strong>(D) \u092c\u0947\u0902\u091c\u0940\u0928 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u090f\u0938\u0940\u091f\u093f\u0915 \u0905\u092e\u094d\u0932 \u0915\u093e \u0935\u093f\u0932\u092f\u0928:</strong> \u0907\u0938 \u092e\u093f\u0936\u094d\u0930\u0923 \u092e\u0947\u0902, \u090f\u0938\u0940\u091f\u093f\u0915 \u0905\u092e\u094d\u0932 \u0926\u094d\u0935\u093f\u0932\u0915\u0940\u0915\u0930\u0923 \u0915\u0940 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0935\u0943\u0924\u094d\u0924\u093f \u0930\u0916\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u090f\u0938\u0940\u091f\u093f\u0915 \u0905\u092e\u094d\u0932 \u0915\u0947 \u0905\u0923\u0941 \u092f\u0941\u0917\u094d\u092e\u093f\u0924 \u0939\u094b\u0915\u0930 \u0926\u094d\u0935\u093f\u0932\u0915 \u092c\u0928\u093e\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902, \u0935\u093f\u0936\u0947\u0937 \u0930\u0942\u092a \u0938\u0947 \u092c\u0947\u0902\u091c\u0940\u0928 \u091c\u0948\u0938\u0947 \u0905\u0927\u094d\u0930\u0941\u0935\u0940\u092f \u0935\u093f\u0932\u093e\u092f\u0915\u094b\u0902 \u092e\u0947\u0902\u0964</p></p>\n\n<p>\u0907\u0928 \u0935\u094d\u092f\u093e\u0916\u094d\u092f\u093e\u0913\u0902 \u0915\u0947 \u0906\u0927\u093e\u0930 \u092a\u0930, \u0938\u0939\u0940 \u092e\u093f\u0932\u093e\u0928 \u0939\u0948\u0902: </p>\n\n<p><p>(A) - (III)</p></p>\n<p><p>(B) - (I)</p></p>\n<p><p>(C) - (IV)</p></p>\n<p><p>(D) - (II)</p></p>"}},"subject":"chemistry","timeAllotted":144000,"topic":"relative-lowering-of-vapour-pressure-and-roults-law","type":"mcq","year":2025,"tags":["matching_table"],"yearKey":"jee-main-2025-online-7th-april-evening-shift","active":true,"options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"<p>(A)-(III), (B)-(I), (C)-(IV), (D)-(II)</p>"},{"identifier":"B","content":"<p>(A)-(III), (B)-(IV), (C)-(I), (D)-(II)</p>"},{"identifier":"C","content":"<p>(A)-(II), (B)-(I), (C)-(IV), (D)-(III)</p>"},{"identifier":"D","content":"<p>(A)-(II), (B)-(IV), (C)-(I), (D)-(III)</p>"}],"correct_options":["A"],"explanation":"<p>To correctly match the items from List - I with those in List - II, let's analyze the characteristics of each solution:</p>\n\n<p><p><strong>(A) Solution of chloroform and acetone:</strong> This solution exhibits negative deviation from Raoult's law. It creates a maximum boiling azeotrope because the interactions between chloroform and acetone molecules are stronger than those in the pure components.</p></p>\n<p><p><strong>(B) Solution of ethanol and water:</strong> This solution shows positive deviation from Raoult's law, leading to the formation of a minimum boiling azeotrope. The interactions between ethanol and water molecules are weaker than those in their pure states.</p></p>\n<p><p><strong>(C) Solution of benzene and toluene:</strong> This combination forms an ideal solution where Raoult\u2019s law is obeyed across all concentrations. Thus, the volume change upon mixing, denoted as <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.72ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.271ex\" height=\"2.34ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 2771.8 1034.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(833,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(616,-176.7) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">mix</text></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, is zero.</p></p>\n<p><p><strong>(D) Solution of acetic acid in benzene:</strong> In this mixture, acetic acid tends to dimerize. The acetic acid molecules pair up, forming dimers, especially in non-polar solvents like benzene.</p></p>\n\n<p>Based on these explanations, the correct matches are: </p>\n\n<p><p>(A) - (III)</p></p>\n<p><p>(B) - (I)</p></p>\n<p><p>(C) - (IV)</p></p>\n<p><p>(D) - (II)</p><